    "answer": "Toby: 2x-10\nRebecca: (2x-10)-8=2x-18\nTotal:2x-10+2x-18+x=157\n5x-28=157\n5x=185\nx=<<37=37>>37 hours\nRebecca:2(37)-18=56 hours\n#### 56"
